          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu gihe imvura yaba itanguye kugabanuka hakaza ici, ni ho abami bahora baja mu ntambara. Yowabu arongora ingabo, aja gutera igihugu c’Abamoni arakinesha; ariko Dawidi yigumira i Yerusalemu. Yowabu yugariza igisagara c’i Raba arakinesha, agihindura umusaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.20.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 20:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dawidi amaze gushika afata urugori rw’ubwami rwari ku mutwe w’umwami waho, asanga rupima italanto imwe",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.20.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20:2",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ni nk’ibilo 34.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " y’inzahabu, kandi rwari rusharijwe n’utubuye tw’agaciro, baca barwambika Dawidi. Atwara iminyago myinshi akuye muri ico gisagara, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.20.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "atwara n’abantu bo muri ico gisagara, abashingira ibikebere, bamwe baba abasatura imbaho, abandi bagakoresha amasipiri n’incabiti. Dawidi abigenza atyo mu bisagara vyose vy’Abamoni. Hanyuma Dawidi n’ingabo zose basubira i Yerusalemu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.20.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
